+<p>
+When a shared <a href="searchparameter.html">SearchParameter</a> is marked as normative and is used on a non-normative resource, the SearchParameter definition is normative and subject
+to normative inter-version compatibility rules.  However, its use, expression, and resource-specific applicability for trial-use or informative resources are still considered trial-use and
+subject to change as those resources evolve. Non-normative resources that use the search parameter may be dropped, and new resources sharing the search parameter may be added.
